wanting to throw away public image,

301
00:31:41,323 --> 00:31:47,063
狂った様に泣き出したい 思うがまま生きて消えていきたいな
wanting to cry like I've gone mad, wanting to live as I please and vanish away.

302
00:31:48,403 --> 00:31:53,103
純情？なにそれ 愛情？なにそれ 美味しいの？ねぇ 美味しいのって なあ
Pure love? What's that? Affection? What's that? Is it tasty? Hey, is it tasty, huh?

303
00:31:53,473 --> 00:31:58,143
乱暴ダメダメ 感情捨て去り いっせーので ぶっ飛ぶだけ
No rough stuff, throw away emotions, all at once, just blast off!

304
00:31:58,423 --> 00:32:03,423
混沌ブギウギ ハッピー特盛 ドンビーシャイだ ドンビーシャイだもう
Chaos Boogie Woogie, happy extra serving, don't be shy, don't be shy anymore,

305
00:32:03,723 --> 00:32:08,043
段々堕ちてく IQ クソワロ いっせーので 死ぬまで踊れ
gradually falling IQ, lmao, all at once, dance until you die!

306
00:32:19,033 --> 00:32:23,533
ワンツーまさかり 三四刈り取り もういいんだって もういいんだってもう
One-two halberd, three-four harvesting, enough is enough, whatever is fine now,

307
00:32:24,133 --> 00:32:27,733
ハッピーおかわり give me トキメキ いっせーので
Happy refill, give me a heartbeat, all at once,

308
00:32:27,733 --> 00:32:29,933
さあ 飛び込め
now jump right in!

309
00:32:29,933 --> 00:32:34,133
本能ブギウギ 混沌特盛 もういいんだって もういいんだってもう
Instinct Boogie Woogie, chaos extra serving, enough is enough, whatever is fine now,

310
00:32:34,133 --> 00:32:38,233
最低 奴等の like a ミステリ いっせーので ぶっ飛ぶだけ
The lowest scum's like a mystery, all at once, just blast off!

311
00:32:39,233 --> 00:32:43,833
混沌ブギウギ ハッピー特盛 ドンビーシャイだ ドンビーシャイだもう
Chaos Boogie Woogie, happy extra serving, don't be shy, don't be shy anymore,

312
00:32:44,133 --> 00:32:48,433
段々堕ちてく 人生クソワロ いっせーので 死ぬまで踊れ
gradually falling life, lmao, all at once, dance until you die!

313
00:32:49,233 --> 00:32:54,233
もういいや全部全部ほら 忘れてしまおう
Forget it all, everything, come on, let's just leave it behind and forget it.

314
00:32:54,533 --> 00:33:00,133
簡単なことじゃないが 我々なら出来るだろうなあ？
It's not an easy thing to do, but if it's us, we can pull it off, right?

315
00:33:01,233 --> 00:33:06,133
イエス イエス
Yes, yes!

316
00:33:42,874 --> 00:33:46,374
[Title: ドラマツルギー]
[Title: Dramaturgy]

317
00:33:55,334 --> 00:34:02,234
頭でわかっては嘆いた 転がってく様子を嗤った 寂しいとか愛とかわかんない 人間の形は投げだしたんだ
I understood in my head and lamented, mocked the way things rolled along. I don't know what loneliness or love is, I threw away the human shape.

318
00:34:02,234 --> 00:34:07,134
抱えきれない 言葉だらけの存在証明を
This proof of existence full of words I couldn't hold onto,

319
00:34:08,134 --> 00:34:14,434
この小さな劇場から出らんない 気づいたら最後逃げ出したい 僕ら全員演じていたんだ エンドロールに向かってゆくんだ
Can't get out of this small theater, if I realize it at the end, I want to run away. We were all acting out our parts, heading toward the end roll.

320
00:34:14,934 --> 00:34:20,434
さあ 皆必死に役を演じて傍観者なんていないのさ
Now, everyone is desperately playing their roles, there are no bystanders.

321
00:34:21,134 --> 00:34:24,434
"ワタシ"なんてないの どこにだって居ないよ
There is no "me", I'm nowhere to be found at all.

322
00:34:24,434 --> 00:34:29,934
ずっと僕は 何者にもなれないで
I've always been unable to become anybody at all.

323
00:34:30,434 --> 00:34:37,434
僕ら今 さあさあ 喰らいあって 延長戦 サレンダーして メーデー 淡い愛想 垂れ流し 言の愛憎
Now, come on, we devour each other, surrendering in extra time, Mayday, faint friendliness, flowing words of affection and hatred.

324
00:34:37,934 --> 00:34:42,934
ドラマチックな展開をどっか期待してんだろう
You must be expecting some dramatic twist somewhere.

325
00:34:43,434 --> 00:34:46,934
君も YES YES 息を呑んで 采配は そこにあんだ
You too, YES YES, holding your breath, the command is right there.

326
00:34:47,434 --> 00:34:52,434
ヘッドショット 騒ぐ想いも その心 撃ち抜いて さあ まだ見ぬ糸を引いて
Headshot, even the clamoring feelings, shooting through that heart, now, pulling unseen threads,

327
00:34:52,934 --> 00:34:59,934
黒幕のお出ましさ "その目に映るのは"
the mastermind makes an appearance. "What is reflected in those eyes?"

328
00:35:05,660 --> 00:35:08,610
触れたら壊れてしまった 間違ってく様子を黙った
It broke when I touched it; I kept quiet as things went wrong.

329
00:35:08,610 --> 00:35:12,780
僕ら全員無垢でありました いつのまにやら怪物になったんだ
We were all innocent before we knew it, we became monsters.

330
00:35:12,780 --> 00:35:18,310
その全てを肯定しないと前に進めないかい
Can we not move forward unless we affirm all of that?

331
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:26,010
『まあ君にはきっと無理なんだ』 「だから君にはきっと無理なんだ」 いつのまにやら外野にいたんだ
"Well, it's bound to be impossible for you." "That's why it's bound to be impossible for you." Before we knew it, we were on the sidelines.

332
00:35:26,010 --> 00:35:31,610
そんなガヤばっかり飛ばしてきたんだ 皆必死に自分を守って救いの手を待ってるのさ
Throwing around all that jeering chatter, everyone is desperately protecting themselves, waiting for a helping hand.

333
00:35:31,910 --> 00:35:35,410
考えたくはないよ 馬鹿になっていたいもん
I don't want to think about it, I just want to be an idiot.

334
00:35:35,410 --> 00:35:40,610
ずっと僕は 何者にもなれないで
Forever unable to become anyone at all...

335
00:35:41,060 --> 00:35:48,760
だから今 前線上に立って その旗は高く舞って 劣勢 頼る相棒 言葉すら必要ないよ
So right now, standing on the front lines, that flag fluttering high, at a disadvantage with a reliable partner—we don't even need words.

336
00:35:48,910 --> 00:35:54,060
ドラマチックな展開をどっか期待してんだろう
You must be expecting a dramatic development somewhere, right?

337
00:35:54,060 --> 00:36:01,160
君も Yes yes 息を呑んで 再会を誓いあって ワンチャンスしかない僕の一瞬をかけるのさ
You too, YES YES, holding your breath, vowing to meet again, wagering my only chance, my single fleeting moment!

338
00:36:01,310 --> 00:36:07,410
クライマックスみたいな 手に汗を握るのさ
Like a climax, clutching our hands in sweaty suspense!

339
00:36:07,860 --> 00:36:13,260
ぽつりと鳴いた 隠してきた真実はどこにもない
It cried softly... The truth we've kept hidden is nowhere to be found.

340
00:36:13,260 --> 00:36:22,210
嗤ってきた奴らに居場所はない 思い出してぽいってして感情はない 流した涙 理由なんてない
There is no place for those who sneered. Remembering and tossing it away, devoid of emotion—the tears we shed have no reason.

341
00:36:23,060 --> 00:36:29,760
優しさに温度も感じられない 差し伸べた手に疑いしかない
We can feel no warmth in kindness, only suspicion toward the outstretched hand.

342
00:36:29,910 --> 00:36:35,360
穴が空いて愛は垂れてしまいになったんだ 倒れそうな僕を覗き込んだんだ
A hole opened up and love spilled out, and I peered into my collapsing self.

343
00:36:35,860 --> 00:36:42,810
諦めかけた人の前にアンタは いつも嘲笑うようにおでましさ
Right before someone about to give up, you always make your appearance as if to sneer.

344
00:36:42,810 --> 00:36:49,010
君にはどんな風に見えてるんだい 呼吸を整えて さあ
How does it look to you? Regulate your breathing, now...

345
00:36:49,260 --> 00:36:54,560
ずっと 僕は 何者にもなれないで
Forever unable to become anyone at all...

346
00:36:54,910 --> 00:37:02,760
僕ら今 さあさあ 喰らいあって 延長戦 サレンダーして メーデー 淡い愛想 垂れ流し 言の愛憎
Now we are biting at each other, surrendering in extra time, Mayday, faint friendliness, spilling out words of love and hate.

347
00:37:02,810 --> 00:37:07,860
ドラマチックな展開をどっか期待してんだろう
You must be expecting a dramatic development somewhere, right?

348
00:37:07,860 --> 00:37:15,110
君も YES YES 息を呑んで 采配は そこにあんだ ヘッドショット 騒ぐ想いも その心 撃ち抜いて さあ
You too, YES YES, holding your breath, the orders are right there—headshot, shooting through those turbulent feelings and that heart, now...

349
00:37:15,110 --> 00:37:21,910
まだ見ぬ糸を引いて 黒幕のお出ましさ
Pulling unseen strings, the mastermind makes an appearance!

350
00:37:22,210 --> 00:37:26,060
"その目に映るのは"
"What is reflected in those eyes..."

351
00:37:32,060 --> 00:37:36,560
[Sign: セレナーデ
Lyrics, Music: なとり]
[Sign: Serenade
Lyrics, Music: Natori]

352
00:37:38,060 --> 00:37:44,910
都合のいい思いを燃やして 呆れた願いはもう手放した
Burning away convenient thoughts, I've already let go of those absurd wishes.

353
00:37:45,060 --> 00:37:50,960
裏切りや秘密が漂って ここから動けない
Betrayal and secrets drift about, and I can't move from here.

354
00:37:51,460 --> 00:37:57,910
生まれてしまった あるいは壊れてしまった あの日あの場所で ずっと 止まったままでいた未来
Born, or perhaps broken, at that place on that day—a future that remained frozen in time ever since.

355
00:37:58,060 --> 00:38:04,910
それでも 心のどこかで君を感じていた 許せない 今の僕は誰？
Even so, I still felt you somewhere in my heart. Who am I right now, unable to forgive?

356
00:38:05,860 --> 00:38:14,960
ねぇ ずっとずっとそばにいたんだ 「勘違いだ」って 嘘じゃないよ 望んだものじゃなくとも あなたに出会えた
Hey, I've been by your side all along. It's not a lie to call it a "misunderstanding." Even if it wasn't what I wished for, I met you.

357
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:22,460
痛みだけが 愛だって信じられるように 僕に触れないで！ 祈る、セレナーデ
So that I can believe only the pain is love—don't touch me! I pray, a serenade.

358
00:38:22,710 --> 00:38:29,010
僕なしで上手く幸せになってね 誰よりもずっと、何を手放しても
Be happily successful without me. More than anyone else, no matter what I let go of...

359
00:38:29,060 --> 00:38:34,860
これが愛だって信じていた、罰をください
...I believed that was love. Please give me punishment.

360
00:38:37,860 --> 00:38:49,260
誰でもない、あなた あなただけ 世界がまだ忘れてくれなくても きっと、まだ あなた あなただけ 願い疲れても歌うよ、セレナーデ
No one else, you, just you alone. Even if the world still won't forget, surely still, you, just you alone—even if I'm tired of wishing, I'll sing a serenade.

361
00:38:52,060 --> 00:38:57,060
願い疲れても歌うよ、セレナーデ
Even if I'm tired of wishing, I'll sing a serenade.

362
00:38:57,760 --> 00:39:09,560
シナリオ通りのコメディ 不幸自慢はハウメニー？ エゴイスティックに光った瞳の中に映っている 「あなた」は「誰？」 暗闇が光らせた舞台の上で 何も知らずにただ踊っていられたならよかった
A comedy straight out of the script. How many boasts of misfortune? Who is the "you" reflected in those egoistically shining eyes? In the darkness upon the illuminated stage, it would have been nice if I could have simply danced without knowing anything.

363
00:39:10,560 --> 00:39:21,860
希望も不幸も身勝手だ 僕らは、全員共犯者だった 疑う余地もないほど 運命が定まった、あの夜から 僕は愛し方を忘れた
Both hope and misfortune are selfish. We were all accomplices. With no room for doubt, ever since that night when fate was sealed, I forgot how to love.

364
00:39:24,360 --> 00:39:30,560
これだけ願って、これだけ祈って こんな、悲しい結末でごめんね
Wishing this much, praying this much—I'm sorry for such a sad ending.

365
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:40,060
すべて失って、すべて消え去っても ただ、君がずっと生きていた 痛みが欲しい
Even if I lose everything, even if everything vanishes away, I just want the pain of knowing you kept on living.

366
00:39:52,560 --> 00:39:59,060
あと、何回数えたら あと、何回傷つけば あと、何回失えば あと、何回壊れたら
How many more times must I count, how many more times must I be hurt, how many more times must I lose, how many more times must I break...

367
00:40:00,192 --> 00:40:05,252
あと何回数えたら あと何回傷つけば あと何回失えば この思いは満たされる？
How many more times must I count, how many more times must I get hurt, how many more times must I lose, before these feelings are fulfilled?

368
00:40:05,252 --> 00:40:08,672
これだけ願って これだけ祈って こんな悲しい結末でごめんね
Wishing this much, praying this much, I'm sorry for such a sad ending.

369
00:40:08,672 --> 00:40:15,112
すべて失って すべてが違っても ただ僕がずっと愛していた君よ
Even if we lose everything, even if everything was wrong, you are the one I always loved.

370
00:40:15,112 --> 00:40:19,132
すべて失って すべてが違っても
Even if we lose everything, even if it's all wrong...

371
00:40:19,132 --> 00:40:23,212
ただ僕がずっと 愛していた君よ
You are the one I always loved...

372
00:40:23,212 --> 00:40:29,532
消えないで 祈るセレナーデ 僕なしで上手く幸せになってね
Don't go, I pray this serenade, wishing you happiness without me.

373
00:40:29,532 --> 00:40:36,292
誰よりもずっと 何を手放しても これが愛だって信じていた
More than anyone, no matter what I gave up, I believed this was love.

374
00:40:36,292 --> 00:40:42,252
罰をください 誰でもない あなた あなただけ世界
Pass down your punishment, you and no one else, you are my only world.

375
00:40:42,252 --> 00:40:52,072
世界がまだ忘れてくれなくても きっと まだ あなた あなただけ 願い疲れても歌うよセレナーデ
Even if the world still can't forget, surely you are still my only wish. Even if I grow tired of wishing, I will sing this serenade...

376
00:40:52,072 --> 00:41:04,052
雨が降り去っても 僕じゃなくたって 願い疲れても歌うよセレナーデ
Even if the rain passes, even if it's not me, even if I grow tired of wishing, I will sing this serenade...

377
00:41:13,631 --> 00:41:16,991
クロニー！ 助けに来たよ！
Kronii! I've come to save you!

378
00:41:21,131 --> 00:41:24,051
やっぱりスバル先輩！
I knew it, Subaru-senpai!

379
00:41:24,051 --> 00:41:26,651
どうして助けが必要ってわかったんですか？
How'd ya know I needed help?

380
00:41:27,251 --> 00:41:30,651
ずっと見てたからね！
I've been watching the whole time!

381
00:41:31,151 --> 00:41:32,591
ずっと見てたんですか…？
The whole time...?

382
00:41:32,591 --> 00:41:35,891
私も？ 見てたよ
And me? I watched you.

383
00:41:36,011 --> 00:41:39,631
あぁ そうですか それは怖いけど
Oh, okay. That's scary, but...

384
00:41:39,631 --> 00:41:43,751
なんで？！ だったらもっと早く助けてほしかったですが！
Then why?! I... I wish you helped me a lot sooner then!

385
00:41:44,371 --> 00:41:58,011
途中から楽しそうにしてたから どうなるか見守ろうかなと思って！
Well, you started having fun halfway through, so I figured I'd see how things played out!

386
00:41:58,311 --> 00:42:02,671
うん 見てた… ただ世界を
Yeah. I watched... just the world.

387
00:42:03,111 --> 00:42:10,011
オッケー うん あぁ世界ね わかりました！ まあ確かに楽しんだ部分もあったかも
Okay, yeah. The world, yeah. Yeah, I mean, I guess I did end up enjoying parts of it.

388
00:42:10,291 --> 00:42:17,471
でしょ？！ だから本当に助けが必要なのかなって思ってたんだよ！
See?! That's why I was wondering whether you actually needed saving!

389
00:42:18,051 --> 00:42:24,591
あぁ 一応ありがとうございます でも本当にここから出るのを手伝ってくれるんですか？
Aw... well thank you, I guess, but can you really help me get out of here?

390
00:42:25,631 --> 00:42:39,911
あと... 待って あと1曲だけ 心を込めて歌って踊れば 家に帰れるよ！
Just... Please wait. Just one more song. If you sing and dance your heart out, you can go home!

391
00:42:40,191 --> 00:42:51,411
本当に？やった！ 世界を見てみて！ 世界！ あぁ あれが世界なんだ
Really? Yay! Just watch the world! The world! Oh, so that's the world.

392
00:42:51,911 --> 00:43:03,291
オッケー 待って ごめん 見入っちゃってた スタッフさん 下上上上上上上 そうそう！ 本当に？！
Oh, okay. Wait. Sorry. I was so fascinated. Please staff, down up up up up up up. Yeah, yeah! Really?!

393
00:43:03,971 --> 00:43:13,171
カエラも戦って歌ったあとに消えたでしょう？ あれは元の世界に帰ったからなんだよ！
Kaela disappeared after fighting and singing, right? That's because she went back to the original world.

394
00:43:13,411 --> 00:43:24,591
あぁ 戦って歌ったあとに？ 待って それって私も戦わなきゃいけないってことですか？ うん！ そう...
Oh. After fighting and singing? Wait, does that mean I have to fight too? Yep! Oh...

395
00:43:31,031 --> 00:43:39,451
わけかんない！ なんでそもそも戦わなきゃいけないの？！ 何かの儀式みたいなものだと思って！
I don't get it! Why do we have to fight at all?! Think of it like some kind of ritual!

396
00:43:40,171 --> 00:44:00,451
オッケーじゃあそこに立って攻撃を受けるだけね そして現実世界に戻ったら ご飯を作って私のこと甘やかしてもらうから！！ やめろ！お願いやめて！やめて！
Okay, then we just stand there and take the hit, and when we get back to the real world, you're going to make me food and spoil me!! Stop! Please stop stop please.

397
00:44:01,131 --> 00:44:07,511
ちょっと！ 正気なの？！
Hey! Are you out of your mind?!

398
00:44:07,811 --> 00:44:18,251
ちょっと待って なんでスバルがご飯作るの？！ それにさっきもう甘やかしてもらってたでしょ！
Wait, why should I cook for you? And besides, you were already getting spoiled earlier!

399
00:44:19,171 --> 00:44:24,571
とにかく！ 楽しむのが大事！ 喜びこそが鍵なんだよ！！
Anyway! You should have fun! Joy is the key!!

400
00:44:25,051 --> 00:44:32,011
ほんとかなぁ？ じゃあ楽しませてください にゃ～！
You sure about that? Then you have to entertain me. Meow!

401
00:44:32,511 --> 00:44:41,351
にゃ～？ 大丈夫...？ とにかく！
Meow? Are you okay? Anyway!

402
00:44:42,071 --> 00:44:50,611
スバ友召喚！ カモン！ スバマジで可愛い！
I summon Subatomo! Come! Subatomo is soooo cute!

403
00:44:51,191 --> 00:45:04,671
マジで可愛いでしょう？ね？ うんでも すぐろっちゃい ちっちゃい！ すぐ小さい うん！ 小さいのが可愛い！ 見るだけで幸せになるでしょ？
This is "super cute" right? Yeah, but so tiny. Tiny? It's so small. Yeah! Small is cute! Just looking at it makes you happy, right?

404
00:45:05,401 --> 00:45:07,221
ああ、おっけー。そう、これらの商品は私の周年を記念したグッズってことね。
Ah, okay. So, these are the merch celebrating my anniversary, hey?

405
00:45:07,481 --> 00:45:09,221
で、ええと、これらになにがあるんだろう？
Let's see. I wonder what they've got.

406
00:45:09,381 --> 00:45:12,221
どれも結構使えそうだから、一緒に見ていこう。
They all seem pretty useful, so let's check it out together.

407
00:45:12,561 --> 00:45:14,201
まずはバケットハット。
First up, we got a bucket hat.

408
00:45:14,821 --> 00:45:17,841
イラストははまなし先生に描いてもらいました。
The illustration was done by Hama Nashi sensei.

409
00:45:18,061 --> 00:45:21,981
コンセプトは私が……みんなの予想通り！ラスボス！
The concept is me being... you guessed it! The final boss!

410
00:45:22,161 --> 00:45:25,441
リバーシブル仕様でイラストもすごくかっこいい！
It's reversible and the artwork looks really cool!

411
00:45:25,661 --> 00:45:29,581
で、たぶんなんとなくだけど防御力も上がりそうだし。
And maybe it would make you feel like it would boost your defense stat?

