00:50:00,240 --> 00:50:10,620
Everything, you'll also receive a cheki-style card with a foil-stamped signature, along with a bonus voice pack.

441
00:50:10,920 --> 00:50:16,970
The card illustration was drawn by, you guessed it, Hamanashi-sensei!

442
00:50:17,420 --> 00:50:32,570
And as for the bonus voice pack, it's going to be telling the story of joining hands and heading into the final battle in order to bring the loop to an end. It's going to be very emotional, so go check it out.

